DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
18519::$$$message_0144_0000_0000$$$::I don't really have anything to do, but I'll stay awake a while longer.[lr]::
18520::$$$message_0144_0000_0001$$$::After that...hospitality, I can't exactly fall asleep.[lr]::
18521::$$$message_0144_0000_0002$$$::It's past 10:00 PM.[lr]::
18522::$$$message_0144_0000_0003$$$::I'm left getting into a defiant staring contest with a stain on the wall that looks not unlike a corpse.::
18523::$$$message_0144_0001_0000$$$::It's been an hour since I lay down on the mattress.[lr]::
18524::$$$message_0144_0001_0001$$$::My indignation at this outrageous treatment has been quashed, and all that's left for me to do is to go to sleep as I'm told, but...[lr]::
18525::$$$message_0144_0001_0002$$$::"...It's cold. It hurts. I can't sleep."[lr]::
18526::$$$message_0144_0001_0003$$$::I'm physically unable to fall asleep, not mentally.[lr]::
18527::$$$message_0144_0001_0004$$$::This must be Sella's plan to break my spirit, since I sleep regularly in the shed. A fearsome foe indeed. Hehehehehe.::
18528::$$$message_0144_0002_0000$$$::"It's freezing though, not gonna lie... She could've at least left me a blanket."[lr]::
18529::$$$message_0144_0002_0001$$$::...No way around it.[lr]::
18530::$$$message_0144_0002_0002$$$::I hate to do this, but it's a matter of life and death.[lr]::
18531::$$$message_0144_0002_0003$$$::I'll sneak out and find something I can use as a blanket.::
18532::$$$message_0144_0003_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18533::$$$message_0144_0003_0001$$$::I hear heavy footsteps echoing in the chilly halls.[lr]::
18534::$$$message_0144_0003_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
18535::$$$message_0144_0003_0003$$$::Each step shaves away my already frayed nerves.[lr]::
18536::$$$message_0144_0003_0004$$$::I didn't think the castle at night would be a big deal, but I'm getting pretty nervous out here on my own.::
18537::$$$message_0144_0004_0000$$$::"Guh!?[lr]::
18538::$$$message_0144_0004_0001$$$::...Oh, that was just the wind.[wvl][se storage=se271.wav] I'm on the fourth floor, so the wind's bound to be stronger up here, haha..."[lr]::
18539::$$$message_0144_0004_0002$$$::...This is bad. [wm canskip=0][movefg textoff=0 rule=右上から左下へ vague=200 opacity=0 left=0 top=0 time=800 accel=0 storage=white]My fear is increasing by the second.[lr]::
18540::$$$message_0144_0004_0003$$$::At this rate, I'm liable to run back to the storage room before I even reach the third floor, [se storage=se654.wav]much less the first-floor lobby.[lr]::
18541::$$$message_0144_0004_0004$$$::It's all so...::
18542::$$$message_0144_0005_0000$$$::"...Damn that Sella. She's got it out for me. Even turned out all the lights in the halls."[lr]::
18543::$$$message_0144_0005_0001$$$::That's right.[lr]::
18544::$$$message_0144_0005_0002$$$::The supposedly nightless Einzbern Castle is completely unlit tonight, of all nights.[lr]::
18545::$$$message_0144_0005_0003$$$::They aren't suddenly trying to cut their electricity bill. This is pure bullying.::
18546::$$$message_0144_0006_0000$$$::"...Damn it, I won't let this break me. [wvl][se volume=40 storage=se654.wav]How am I supposed to learn magecraft if I can't handle walking around a castle at night?"[lr]::
18547::$$$message_0144_0006_0001$$$::I walk down the hall, flinching at the sound of my own footsteps.[lr]::
18548::$$$message_0144_0006_0002$$$::...Just a little longer to the stairs.[lr]::
18549::$$$message_0144_0006_0003$$$::This'll work out as long as I can reach the ground floor.[lr]::
18550::$$$message_0144_0006_0004$$$::Most of the doors are locked, but the salon should still be open.[lr]::
18551::$$$message_0144_0006_0005$$$::I'm sure I can find something there that'll serve as a blanket.::
18552::$$$message_0144_0007_0000$$$::"Oh, nice. I see lights!"[lr]::
18553::$$$message_0144_0007_0001$$$::Even Sella didn't completely douse the lights in the lobby.::
18554::$$$message_0144_0008_0000$$$::"Good, good. It's so damn big that it still gives me the creeps, but this is better than the hallway."[lr]::
18555::$$$message_0144_0008_0001$$$::I quietly descend the central staircase.[lr]::
18556::$$$message_0144_0008_0002$$$::The salon should be that way. The lobby's well-lit, so some of that light should reach the salon, too.::
18557::$$$message_0144_0009_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18558::$$$message_0144_0009_0001$$$::I was too naïve.[lr]::
18559::$$$message_0144_0009_0002$$$::And this is way weirder than it needs to be.[lr]::
18560::$$$message_0144_0009_0003$$$::Ghostly aristocrats wouldn't look out of place dancing here among the Rococo-style furnishings.::
18561::$$$message_0144_0010_0000$$$::"...Whatever. Just gotta find something that'll work as a blanket..."[lr]::
18562::$$$message_0144_0010_0001$$$::I move stealthily inside.[lr]::
18563::$$$message_0144_0010_0002$$$::The fluffy carpet muffles my footsteps, but the complete silence is creeping me out.[lr]::
18564::$$$message_0144_0010_0003$$$::If things are this quiet, [se volume=35 storage=se190.wav]I feel like I won't notice if someone sneaks up behind me[line len=2]::
18565::$$$message_0144_0011_0000$$$::...Hold on.[lr]::
18566::$$$message_0144_0011_0001$$$::Did I just hear something?::
18567::$$$message_0144_0012_0000$$$::...I did.[lr]::
18568::$$$message_0144_0012_0001$$$::Something white is moving behind that glass chest of drawers in the corner of the room.[lr]::
18569::$$$message_0144_0012_0002$$$::"...Ngh."[lr]::
18570::$$$message_0144_0012_0003$$$::I've heard rumors of sinister things appearing in the castle lately.[lr]::
18571::$$$message_0144_0012_0004$$$::Ghosts roaming the forest.[lr]::
18572::$$$message_0144_0012_0005$$$::The monster Illya saw underground.[lr]::
18573::$$$message_0144_0012_0006$$$::And something lurking in the darkened parlor...::
18574::$$$message_0144_0013_0000$$$::I crouch and slowly move deeper into the room.[lr]::
18575::$$$message_0144_0013_0001$$$::Using the table as a shield, I position myself so that I can run if anything happens...::
18576::$$$message_0144_0014_0000$$$::                                              "Wh-who's there!?"[lr]::
18577::$$$message_0144_0014_0001$$$::                                              "Y-you first!"::
18578::$$$message_0144_0015_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
18579::$$$message_0144_0015_0001$$$::We slowly lock eyes, like arranged marriage prospects meeting for the first time.::
18580::$$$message_0144_0016_0000$$$::"...I see. You came down to the first floor looking for a blanket to help you weather the cold.[lr]::
18581::$$$message_0144_0016_0001$$$::My apologies. I should have provided a little more warmth for a guest from the outside."::
18582::$$$message_0144_0017_0000$$$::"Y-yeah. I'd appreciate that."[lr]::
18583::$$$message_0144_0017_0001$$$::"Very well. I will have a blanket sent up immediately."[lr]::
18584::$$$message_0144_0017_0002$$$::Sella's going to honor my request.[lr]::
18585::$$$message_0144_0017_0003$$$::...It's a little anticlimactic, but I'm not complaining.::
18586::$$$message_0144_0018_0000$$$::"On another note, I must apologize for my rudeness. Given the late hour and the dimly lit parlor, I mistook you for a burglar, Master Emiya."::
18587::$$$message_0144_0019_0000$$$::"Nah, that goes for me, too. I didn't think you'd be here, so I thought you were a gho[line len=2]"[lr]::
18588::$$$message_0144_0019_0001$$$::"On yet another note, what would you like for breakfast tomorrow morning? Would you prefer rice instead of bread?"::
18589::$$$message_0144_0020_0000$$$::"Huh? Um, bread's fine."[lr]::
18590::$$$message_0144_0020_0001$$$::"Then we will serve bread. Please let me know if you have any other requests."[lr]::
18591::$$$message_0144_0020_0002$$$::Sella talks quickly.[lr]::
18592::$$$message_0144_0020_0003$$$::She's certainly proving to be a refined maid, but...::
18593::$$$message_0144_0021_0000$$$::"I don't have any other requests. I'll go back to my room once I get a blanket. So, um..."[lr]::
18594::$$$message_0144_0021_0001$$$::I hold out my hand.::
18595::$$$message_0144_0022_0000$$$::"What is it, Master Emiya?"[lr]::
18596::$$$message_0144_0022_0001$$$::"A blanket. You don't need to bring it up to the fourth floor. Just give it to me here."::
18597::$$$message_0144_0023_0000$$$::"If I might change the topic a third time, what time do you typically wake, Master Emiya? I will arrange for a morning call."[lr]::
18598::$$$message_0144_0023_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
18599::$$$message_0144_0023_0002$$$::[font italic=true]This[font italic=false] is what I'm talking about.[lr]::
18600::$$$message_0144_0023_0003$$$::Sella is stubbornly refusing to give me a blanket.::
18601::$$$message_0144_0024_0000$$$::"...Fine, I'll go back to my room. Please send the blanket up as soon as you can."[lr]::
18602::$$$message_0144_0024_0001$$$::I say goodbye and start walking back to the stairs.::
18603::$$$message_0144_0025_0000$$$::"...Are you available?"[lr]::
18604::$$$message_0144_0025_0001$$$::The maid blocks my path.::
18605::$$$message_0144_0026_0000$$$::"...What?"[lr]::
18606::$$$message_0144_0026_0001$$$::"I asked if you have any spare time right now."[lr]::
18607::$$$message_0144_0026_0002$$$::"Did you hear a word I said?"::
18608::$$$message_0144_0027_0000$$$::"Very good. Then, allow me to present you with some work. In the left inner side of this lobby...[cacheimage storage=セラ01a(中)][wvl][dash textoff=0 hidefg=0 mx=-104 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=130 imag=1 time=1000 cy=399 mag=1.3 my=0 storage=iアインツロビー(fd)-(紫) rot=-0.0 accel=0][movefg textoff=0 opacity=255 time=1000 pos=r accel=0 storage=セラ01a(中)][lr]::
18609::$$$message_0144_0027_0001$$$::Can you see it over there? [wvl][wm canskip=0][wdash canskip=0]If you follow that passage, it will take you to stairs leading underground.[lr]::
18610::$$$message_0144_0027_0002$$$::There is a wooden door at the very bottom of the stairs. Please go inside, do one round of the room, and come back here."::
18611::$$$message_0144_0028_0000$$$::"...Wait. That's the wine cellar I heard about today."[lr]::
18612::$$$message_0144_0028_0001$$$::"That would be the name for it, yes. And?"[lr]::
18613::$$$message_0144_0028_0002$$$::"So you're telling me to go check it out in your place?"[lr]::
18614::$$$message_0144_0028_0003$$$::"Regrettably, I am preoccupied with other tasks, so I can't spare the effort to inspect the wine cellar."::
18615::$$$message_0144_0029_0000$$$::"...Just asking, but what happens if I refuse?"[lr]::
18616::$$$message_0144_0029_0001$$$::"Well, I suppose that you might not ever receive a blanket."[lr]::
18617::$$$message_0144_0029_0002$$$::"Th-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]that's dirty! You planned this all along, you conniving maid!"::
18618::$$$message_0144_0030_0000$$$::"I would never do such a thing.[lr]::
18619::$$$message_0144_0030_0001$$$::I hardly need to mention that this matter is between us and us alone.[lr]::
18620::$$$message_0144_0030_0002$$$::If I were to recount the facts, you had a secret meeting with me at night. I believe you would not want that news getting out."::
18621::$$$message_0144_0031_0000$$$::"Guh..."[lr]::
18622::$$$message_0144_0031_0001$$$::W-w-w-what the hell's wrong with this maid!? First extortion, and now blackmail!?::
18623::$$$message_0144_0032_0000$$$::"So you don't want Leys to know?[lr]::
18624::$$$message_0144_0032_0001$$$::...That's so dumb. You should've just asked her instead of bluffing. Leys wouldn't laugh at you."::
18625::$$$message_0144_0033_0000$$$::"That is none of your concern.[lr]::
18626::$$$message_0144_0033_0001$$$::Are you going to undertake this task or not?"[lr]::
18627::$$$message_0144_0033_0002$$$::"I'll do it, on one condition: you have to come with me part of the way. Leys might notice if you don't at least do that."[lr]::
18628::$$$message_0144_0033_0003$$$::"T-[wvl canskip=0 time=400]true, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]I suppose.[lr]::
18629::$$$message_0144_0033_0004$$$::Will it be sufficient to accompany you midway down the stairs?"::
18630::$$$message_0144_0034_0000$$$::"Yeah. And make sure to give me a blanket afterward."[lr]::
18631::$$$message_0144_0034_0001$$$::"Yes. [cacheimage storage=セラ01c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セラ01c(中)]I promise you the most luxurious of blankets."[lr]::
18632::$$$message_0144_0034_0002$$$::It's a deal.[lr]::
18633::$$$message_0144_0034_0003$$$::Time to go spelunking, then.::
18634::$$$message_0144_0035_0000$$$::We descend the stairs.[lr]::
18635::$$$message_0144_0035_0001$$$::The stairway is wider than I expected, about two meters wide.::
18636::$$$message_0144_0036_0000$$$::"Master Emiya, I have a condition as well."[lr]::
18637::$$$message_0144_0036_0001$$$::"Hm? Sure, what?"[lr]::
18638::$$$message_0144_0036_0002$$$::"Whatever happens, do not speak of it."[lr]::
18639::$$$message_0144_0036_0003$$$::I turn around.[lr]::
18640::$$$message_0144_0036_0004$$$::...I can't see Sella's face in the dark, but I can tell that she's clinging to me.[lr]::
18641::$$$message_0144_0036_0005$$$::It's obvious from the way she's clutching my shirt.::
18642::$$$message_0144_0037_0000$$$::"Uh... You mean I can't tell you what I see?"[lr]::
18643::$$$message_0144_0037_0001$$$::"Yes. No matter what happens, do not describe what you see down there. Simply report whether it was dangerous or not."[lr]::
18644::$$$message_0144_0037_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
18645::$$$message_0144_0037_0003$$$::At this point, my feelings toward her are progressing from exasperation to sympathy.::
18646::$$$message_0144_0038_0000$$$::"As you wish. Wait here, Sella. I'll check out the cellar."[lr]::
18647::$$$message_0144_0038_0001$$$::"Thank you. Master Emiya, [cacheimage storage=セラ02d(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 color=0xBB404040 time=300 storage=セラ02d(近)]please remember to be discreet. [cacheimage storage=セラ01a(近)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 mono=1 color=0xBB404040 time=300 storage=セラ01a(近)]Silence is golden."[lr]::
18648::$$$message_0144_0038_0002$$$::That's not exactly what that saying means, but she gets her desperation across.::
18649::$$$message_0144_0039_0000$$$::I leave Sella and proceed to the bottom of the stairs.[lr]::
18650::$$$message_0144_0039_0001$$$::"The door is...here."[lr]::
18651::$$$message_0144_0039_0002$$$::I feel around and locate the wooden door.[lr]::
18652::$$$message_0144_0039_0003$$$::Now I just need to go inside.[lr]::
18653::$$$message_0144_0039_0004$$$::"...What am I getting cold feet for? Can't learn magecraft if I'm afraid of a ghost or two."[lr]::
18654::$$$message_0144_0039_0005$$$::I repeat the pep talk I gave myself earlier and push the door open.::
18655::$$$message_0144_0040_0000$$$::..............................................................................................................................................................................[wait canskip=0 time=1000]All clear, for now.[lr]::
18656::$$$message_0144_0040_0001$$$::There isn't a speck of dust to be seen.[lr]::
18657::$$$message_0144_0040_0002$$$::They must keep this place clean.[lr]::
18658::$$$message_0144_0040_0003$$$::I can't see the whole room without any light, but I do see what appear to be densely packed wine barrels.::
18659::$$$message_0144_0041_0000$$$::"...Huh. I expected to smell alcohol..."[lr]::
18660::$$$message_0144_0041_0001$$$::I gingerly step into the room.[lr]::
18661::$$$message_0144_0041_0002$$$::Focusing my senses, I search the darkness.[lr]::
18662::$$$message_0144_0041_0003$$$::...Nothing weird so far.[lr]::
18663::$$$message_0144_0041_0004$$$::I would expect to spot a ghost or two in this environment, but I don't sense any spiritual abnormalities.[lr]::
18664::$$$message_0144_0041_0005$$$::This just looks like a regular, if slightly eerie, wine cellar.::
18665::$$$message_0144_0042_0000$$$::"...Urgh. I told her it was just a normal wine cellarrreeek..."[lr]::
18666::$$$message_0144_0042_0001$$$::Something's here.[lr]::
18667::$$$message_0144_0042_0002$$$::Something unreal is lurking in the darkness.[lr]::
18668::$$$message_0144_0042_0003$$$::Every hair on my body stands on end.[lr]::
18669::$$$message_0144_0042_0004$$$::This isn't some puny ghost. Whatever's in front of me, it's a fanged monster capable of murderous brutality[line len=2][lr]::
18670::$$$message_0144_0042_0005$$$::"I-i-i-i-i-i-it's here!!!"::
18671::$$$message_0144_0043_0000$$$::"Sella, Sella, Sella! [wvl][se storage=se344.wav]Illya was right, there's something down here!"[lr]::
18672::$$$message_0144_0043_0001$$$::"W-w-why are you running this way, Master Emiya!? Th-that isn't what you promised! I don't need a detailed description! [wvl][se storage=se206.wav]Be a man and fight it to death!"::
18673::$$$message_0144_0044_0000$$$::"That's crazy! You should've seen that thing! It was downright evil, like a freshly severed head of a dragon with feet! [wvl][se storage=se044.wav]No way in hell I'm facing that down in the dark!"[lr]::
18674::$$$message_0144_0044_0001$$$::"What nonsense! Its mouth takes up a third of its body?[wvl][se storage=se045.wav] No such creature exists!"::
18675::$$$message_0144_0045_0000$$$::"There's plenty! All right, I'll take you to the zoo next time! You can look at all the sharks and alligators you want!"[lr]::
18676::$$$message_0144_0045_0001$$$::"Kyaaaah! No, don't come any closer! The g-ghost is chasing you!"::
18677::$$$message_0144_0046_0000$$$::Time to retreat to the surface.[lr]::
18678::$$$message_0144_0046_0001$$$::Sella's clinging to my left arm, but my willpower will carry us back up there at max speed.::
18679::$$$message_0144_0047_0000$$$::"Eeek, it's coming![lr]::
18680::$$$message_0144_0047_0001$$$::Sella, where to now?! Sella!"[lr]::
18681::$$$message_0144_0047_0002$$$::"The second floor...is off limits, we mustn't endanger my mistress![lr]::
18682::$$$message_0144_0047_0003$$$::Outside, Master Emiya! We can limit our casualties outside!"::
18683::$$$message_0144_0048_0000$$$::"I'd like to know which 'casualties' you mean exactly, but I'm not going to ask right now! [wvl][se storage=se101.wav][dash textoff=0 mx=730 opacity=255 layer=base irot=-0.0 cx=18 imag=2 time=300 cy=427 mag=2 my=0 storage=iアインツロビー(fd)-(紫) rot=-0.0 accel=-3]Okay, outside we go!"[lr]::
18684::$$$message_0144_0048_0001$$$::"[font italic=true]Not that way![font italic=false] That way is the courtyard, a roadblock, a cul-de-sac! If we go there, it's a dead end!!!"::
18685::$$$message_0144_0049_0000$$$::Her warning is too late.[lr]::
18686::$$$message_0144_0049_0001$$$::We run into the courtyard, and the monster from the wine cellar[lr]::
18687::$$$message_0144_0049_0002$$$::blocks our exit with its massive body.::
18688::$$$message_0144_0050_0000$$$::"We're finished..."[lr]::
18689::$$$message_0144_0050_0001$$$::"Ahh... I was a fool to rely on a human..."[lr]::
18690::$$$message_0144_0050_0002$$$::We both fall to our knees.[lr]::
18691::$$$message_0144_0050_0003$$$::...Heavy iron creaks on the ground.[lr]::
18692::$$$message_0144_0050_0004$$$::Resigned to our fate, we turn to face the monster behind us...[lr]::
18693::$$$message_0144_0050_0005$$$::"What a surprise. Shirou and Sella, are you friends?"[lr]::
18694::$$$message_0144_0050_0006$$$::...and all three of us stare at each other.::
18695::$$$message_0144_0051_0000$$$::"Leysritt...? Are you the one who Master Emiya saw in the wine cellar...?"[lr]::
18696::$$$message_0144_0051_0001$$$::"...? I was just standing guard at the wine cellar.[lr]::
18697::$$$message_0144_0051_0002$$$::Someone was in there, so I chased them all the way here."::
18698::$$$message_0144_0052_0000$$$::"...I see. Do you have anything to say for yourself, Master Emiya?"[lr]::
18699::$$$message_0144_0052_0001$$$::"...No, ma'am. The truth is as you see it."[lr]::
18700::$$$message_0144_0052_0002$$$::There's no need to explain.[lr]::
18701::$$$message_0144_0052_0003$$$::The shadow I saw in the wine cellar was Leys, and she chased me out because she mistook me for a thief.::
18702::$$$message_0144_0053_0000$$$::"...? You went into the wine cellar, Shirou?"[lr]::
18703::$$$message_0144_0053_0001$$$::"Yeah. I was curious about the ghost story today, so I went to check it out... I'm ashamed to say I thought you were the ghost, and I ran away."[lr]::
18704::$$$message_0144_0053_0002$$$::"...Oh. What about you, Sella? Why are you with Shirou?"::
18705::$$$message_0144_0054_0000$$$::"Huh? W-well, I..."[lr]::
18706::$$$message_0144_0054_0001$$$::"I ran into her in the lobby on the way back.[lr]::
18707::$$$message_0144_0054_0002$$$::She got mad at me because I was running in the halls, as always."::
18708::$$$message_0144_0055_0000$$$::"Oh. Sella's always mad."::
18709::$$$message_0144_0056_0000$$$::Leys believes me without question.[lr]::
18710::$$$message_0144_0056_0001$$$::Sorry, Leys. I did promise Sella not to talk about it to anyone.::
18711::$$$message_0144_0057_0000$$$::"...Ahem. As Master Emiya said, I was about to head down to the cellar myself. I didn't expect that you would also be there.[lr]::
18712::$$$message_0144_0057_0001$$$::More importantly, Leysritt, did you find anything down there?"::
18713::$$$message_0144_0058_0000$$$::"Nothing. Shirou came in and ran away. That's all."[lr]::
18714::$$$message_0144_0058_0001$$$::"...I see. I thought that perhaps Lady Illyasviel witnessed something abnormal, rather than just an intruder..."[lr]::
18715::$$$message_0144_0058_0002$$$::"...But there was nothing there. I don't think the ghosts in the forest are in the castle."::
18716::$$$message_0144_0059_0000$$$::"Of course not. Such feeble entities could never enter the Einzbern Castle.[lr]::
18717::$$$message_0144_0059_0001$$$::Only spirits of high spiritual caliber can enter this castle. Things that can only turn into black shades would not stand a chance."[lr]::
18718::$$$message_0144_0059_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
18719::$$$message_0144_0059_0003$$$::What a curious person.[lr]::
18720::$$$message_0144_0059_0004$$$::She's afraid of ghosts, but she doesn't reject them outright.::
18721::$$$message_0144_0060_0000$$$::"What, Master Emiya? You look like you have something to say."[lr]::
18722::$$$message_0144_0060_0001$$$::"Nah, just thinking to myself.[lr]::
18723::$$$message_0144_0060_0002$$$::Sella, you said that the ghosts in the forest can't enter the castle?"::
18724::$$$message_0144_0061_0000$$$::"They cannot. The castle boasts comprehensive spiritual defenses. Spirits would flock from throughout the woods otherwise."[lr]::
18725::$$$message_0144_0061_0001$$$::"Ah-ha. And you mentioned that Illya saw a suspicious shadow underground. By the way, Leys, how long have you been doing what you just did earlier?"::
18726::$$$message_0144_0062_0000$$$::"Um..."[lr]::
18727::$$$message_0144_0062_0001$$$::"We rotate guard duty once every three days.[lr]::
18728::$$$message_0144_0062_0002$$$::But we don't patrol underground like we did tonight. Leysritt has superior mobility, but her operating time is brief. She would collapse if she had to work every day without rest."[lr]::
18729::$$$message_0144_0062_0003$$$::"......Y-yeah. I would."::
18730::$$$message_0144_0063_0000$$$::"...Leysritt? Don't tell me..."[lr]::
18731::$$$message_0144_0063_0001$$$::"...Sorry, Sella.[lr]::
18732::$$$message_0144_0063_0002$$$::I've been doing more patrols lately because Illya's scared."[lr]::
18733::$$$message_0144_0063_0003$$$::"Wha...!? Then the shadow Lady Illyasviel saw was you!?"[lr]::
18734::$$$message_0144_0063_0004$$$::"...Yeah. If it scared Shirou too, then it was probably me."::
18735::$$$message_0144_0064_0000$$$::...Heck yeah, I was scared.[lr]::
18736::$$$message_0144_0064_0001$$$::Even Illya would be surprised if Leys rounded a corner carrying that massive weapon in the middle of the night.::
18737::$$$message_0144_0065_0000$$$::"Leysritt, you...!"[lr]::
18738::$$$message_0144_0065_0001$$$::I can understand why Sella's upset. Leys could have chosen a more peaceable way to patrol at night.::
18739::$$$message_0144_0066_0000$$$::"Why would you do this?[lr]::
18740::$$$message_0144_0066_0001$$$::You should understand your own abilities."[lr]::
18741::$$$message_0144_0066_0002$$$::"...Yeah. But I have to work hard for Illya. [cacheimage storage=リズ01d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=リズ01d(中)]She'll be happy if the castle's warm."::
18742::$$$message_0144_0067_0000$$$::Such admirable loyalty.[lr]::
18743::$$$message_0144_0067_0001$$$::Leys has been going on patrol every night to make Illya more comfortable.::
18744::$$$message_0144_0068_0000$$$::"You did good. You really do love Illya, Leys."[lr]::
18745::$$$message_0144_0068_0001$$$::"Yeah. I'm happy when she's happy."[lr]::
18746::$$$message_0144_0068_0002$$$::Wow...what a paragon of a maid. I have a sudden urge to pat her on the head.::
18747::$$$message_0144_0069_0000$$$::"...I understand the situation now. [cacheimage storage=セラ01c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セラ01c(中)]Out of respect for your love for our mistress, I will overlook tonight's incident."[lr]::
18748::$$$message_0144_0069_0001$$$::"...Are you mad, Sella?"::
18749::$$$message_0144_0070_0000$$$::"Of course I am. If you don't want to anger me any further, then go back to your room this instant and rest.[lr]::
18750::$$$message_0144_0070_0001$$$::Your health does not only belong to you. I'm sure you understand my meaning, Leysritt."::
18751::$$$message_0144_0071_0000$$$::"...I'm sorry, Sella. [l][say storage=makyo13_riz_0141 name=リズ]I'll go back now."[lr]::
18752::$$$message_0144_0071_0001$$$::Leys plods out of the courtyard[lr]::
18753::$$$message_0144_0071_0002$$$::like an abandoned puppy.::
18754::$$$message_0144_0072_0000$$$::"...That was a little harsh, Sella.[lr]::
18755::$$$message_0144_0072_0001$$$::Leys said she did all those patrols for Illya."::
18756::$$$message_0144_0073_0000$$$::"That is the problem.[lr]::
18757::$$$message_0144_0073_0001$$$::Leysritt cannot alter her operational time on a whim, like you and I can.[lr]::
18758::$$$message_0144_0073_0002$$$::She is strictly limited to twelve hours of activity a day. If she exceeds this, it will shorten her lifespan.[lr]::
18759::$$$message_0144_0073_0003$$$::Knowing this, would you still ask me to forgive her actions tonight?"::
18760::$$$message_0144_0074_0000$$$::"...So that's how it is.[lr]::
18761::$$$message_0144_0074_0001$$$::...Sorry. I was acting like a know-it-all without knowing the situation at all."[lr]::
18762::$$$message_0144_0074_0002$$$::"Hmph. At least now you understand that you are nothing but a layman. Use this lesson to inform your words in the future."[lr]::
18763::$$$message_0144_0074_0003$$$::Can't argue with that.[lr]::
18764::$$$message_0144_0074_0004$$$::It's true that I've been interacting with these two without thinking about their position lately.::
18765::$$$message_0144_0075_0000$$$::"...There was no helping it, I suppose.[lr]::
18766::$$$message_0144_0075_0001$$$::You are unaware of what we are capable of.[lr]::
18767::$$$message_0144_0075_0002$$$::Physical weakness is unavoidable, but ignorance can be overcome with effort. If you wish to make amends, then you should learn from this feeling."::
18768::$$$message_0144_0076_0000$$$::Her words are severe, but they lack their usual animosity.[lr]::
18769::$$$message_0144_0076_0001$$$::They're about a tenth as spiteful as usual.[lr]::
18770::$$$message_0144_0076_0002$$$::I feel like I'm being scolded rather than hated.::
18771::$$$message_0144_0077_0000$$$::"...I'll try.[lr]::
18772::$$$message_0144_0077_0001$$$::What about you, Sella? You told Leys to rest, but you've been awake for the same length of time. You did mention that you're different from her, though."::
18773::$$$message_0144_0078_0000$$$::"...I just asked you to learn, but you desire a lesson already?[lr]::
18774::$$$message_0144_0078_0001$$$::Very well. If you are to be at my mistress's side, then you shouldn't be completely ignorant."::
18775::$$$message_0144_0079_0000$$$::"Leysritt and I are sister units... No, we are the same model of homunculus, but we were each built for different purposes.[lr]::
18776::$$$message_0144_0079_0001$$$::I was created as a pure homunculus, while Leysritt was created to be a Mystic Code for our mistress.[lr]::
18777::$$$message_0144_0079_0002$$$::I serve Lady Illyasviel as a maid, while Leysritt is a literal part of her."::
18778::$$$message_0144_0080_0000$$$::"Leys is part of Illya? By Mystic Code, do you mean..."[lr]::
18779::$$$message_0144_0080_0001$$$::The Dress of Heaven...[lr]::
18780::$$$message_0144_0080_0002$$$::An external Magic Circuit to reach the Third Magic, cultivated by the Einzbern magi over a thousand years.[lr]::
18781::$$$message_0144_0080_0003$$$::Illya was created as a Lesser Grail. When she puts the dress on, she functions as the original and perfect Illyasviel.::
18782::$$$message_0144_0081_0000$$$::"Leysritt is a homunculus created to allow our mistress to wear the Dress of Heaven. This is why she lacks certain basic abilities of a homunculus.[lr]::
18783::$$$message_0144_0081_0001$$$::I might describe her as an Einzbern-made Pseudo-Servant.[lr]::
18784::$$$message_0144_0081_0002$$$::In exchange for being a familiar with superior combat abilities, Leysritt lacks the majority of her senses, and even her ego is deficient."::
18785::$$$message_0144_0082_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18786::$$$message_0144_0082_0001$$$::Then, the reason Leys talks so haltingly isn't because she isn't used to speaking Japanese, but because...::
18787::$$$message_0144_0083_0000$$$::"Lest you jump to the wrong conclusions, Master Emiya,[lr]::
18788::$$$message_0144_0083_0001$$$::Leysritt is in no way inferior to you. Like Lady Illyasviel, she is a success that one might consider a crystallization of the Einzberns' wisdom.[lr]::
18789::$$$message_0144_0083_0002$$$::...If I had to describe a flaw, it would be that our patriarch was too good at his work.[lr]::
18790::$$$message_0144_0083_0003$$$::She was only meant to be a clump of Ether that manifests the Dress of Heaven, but she was furnished with an ego, incomplete though it may be."::
18791::$$$message_0144_0084_0000$$$::"Leysritt and I were created approximately two years ago.[lr]::
18792::$$$message_0144_0084_0001$$$::By human standards, Leysritt is still a child, but the concept of age is immaterial to us homunculi.[lr]::
18793::$$$message_0144_0084_0002$$$::We inherit all the knowledge and ethos we require from nature upon the moment of our birth. We do not need to waste time maturing over a number of years."::
18794::$$$message_0144_0085_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
18795::$$$message_0144_0085_0001$$$::Sella says that they don't mature.[lr]::
18796::$$$message_0144_0085_0002$$$::It follows that they won't grow any further, either.[lr]::
18797::$$$message_0144_0085_0003$$$::"Hold on. But Illya does..."::
18798::$$$message_0144_0086_0000$$$::"Our mistress was born from Lady Irisviel's egg and Kiritsugu Emiya's sperm.[lr]::
18799::$$$message_0144_0086_0001$$$::It is true that she began life like a human infant, but her growth has stopped at its current stage."::
18800::$$$message_0144_0087_0000$$$::"She is a higher order of life, both homunculus and human.[lr]::
18801::$$$message_0144_0087_0001$$$::In our eyes, she is none other than a miracle. Impure creatures such as humans are unworthy to touch her."::
18802::$$$message_0144_0088_0000$$$::Sella sounds breathless.[lr]::
18803::$$$message_0144_0088_0001$$$::...So that's why she's always so hostile. Sella doesn't only see Illya as the Einzbern heiress. She has a prejudice against me because of how proud she is of Illya.::
18804::$$$message_0144_0089_0000$$$::"...Wait, two years?[lr]::
18805::$$$message_0144_0089_0001$$$::Then you're both younger than me?"::
18806::$$$message_0144_0090_0000$$$::"I told you that we lack a concept of age.[lr]::
18807::$$$message_0144_0090_0001$$$::We will always be both older and younger than you.[lr]::
18808::$$$message_0144_0090_0002$$$::A perfect homunculus is a tactile sense of nature, created by humans. As long as we are connected to this planet, as long as its mana fills the atmosphere, we will never die."[lr]::
18809::$$$message_0144_0090_0003$$$::"Wow. So you're immortal...?"::
18810::$$$message_0144_0091_0000$$$::"Unfortunately, we will still perish if destroyed. While our concept of mortality is stronger than yours, we are vastly inferior organisms.[lr]::
18811::$$$message_0144_0091_0001$$$::Leysritt may have overcome some of those limits...but she is excessively synchronized with our mistress. Once Lady Illyasviel's vital functions halt, Leysritt will cease to function as well."::
18812::$$$message_0144_0092_0000$$$::"...You mean Leys will die if Illya dies?"[lr]::
18813::$$$message_0144_0092_0001$$$::"Yes. Leysritt is our mistress's tool. She is a literal part of her. If Lady Illyasviel, the main body, dies, then it will affect her terminal, Leysritt."::
18814::$$$message_0144_0093_0000$$$::"Still, there are advantages to this arrangement.[lr]::
18815::$$$message_0144_0093_0001$$$::Leysritt lacked a concrete psyche when she was created, but she gained an intellect once she was connected to our mistress."::
18816::$$$message_0144_0094_0000$$$::"You heard what she said earlier: that she is happy if her mistress is happy.[lr]::
18817::$$$message_0144_0094_0001$$$::It is the truth.[lr]::
18818::$$$message_0144_0094_0002$$$::Leysritt, with her weak sense of self, is learning to imitate being human by emulating her mistress."::
18819::$$$message_0144_0095_0000$$$::"...That girl sees our mistress as both a treasure to protect and a part of herself.[cacheimage storage=セラ01c汗(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=800][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=セラ01c汗(中)] Of course, she is so engrossed in this notion that she sometimes forgets her own bodily limits."::
18820::$$$message_0144_0096_0000$$$::"She's putting the cart before the horse," grumbles Sella.[lr]::
18821::$$$message_0144_0096_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
18822::$$$message_0144_0096_0002$$$::So that's why Leys works so hard to help Illya.[lr]::
18823::$$$message_0144_0096_0003$$$::...Illya represents something Leys can't obtain herself.[lr]::
18824::$$$message_0144_0096_0004$$$::Illya is her hope. She gives Leys something that she never had before.::
18825::$$$message_0144_0097_0000$$$::"...Hey, you said that Leys would share Illya's fate if something bad ever happened to her.[lr]::
18826::$$$message_0144_0097_0001$$$::But what about you? You're a homunculus too, so..."::
18827::$$$message_0144_0098_0000$$$::"I cannot synchronize with my mistress to that degree.[lr]::
18828::$$$message_0144_0098_0001$$$::While Leysritt was forged solely from Einzbern Mystics, I was created using ordinary alchemy.[lr]::
18829::$$$message_0144_0098_0002$$$::I function perfectly as a homunculus, but I cannot achieve miracles like Lady Illyasviel and Leysritt. Once they leave for the Seat of Heaven, my role is to rot away here."[lr]::
18830::$$$message_0144_0098_0003$$$::"..."::
18831::$$$message_0144_0099_0000$$$::"What are you looking at me like that for?[lr]::
18832::$$$message_0144_0099_0001$$$::While I don't mean to boast, my Magic Circuits are of exceptional quality, even if I am physically lacking. I do not require a human's pity, much less that of a half-baked mage such as you, Shirou Emiya."::
18833::$$$message_0144_0100_0000$$$::...Apparently Sella is both Illya's governess and magecraft tutor.[lr]::
18834::$$$message_0144_0100_0001$$$::She's a maid who was made to specialize in magecraft to the point where she could teach Illya.[lr]::
18835::$$$message_0144_0100_0002$$$::It's no surprise she'd have such a low opinion of me.::
18836::$$$message_0144_0101_0000$$$::"...Half-baked, huh? I've been doing what I can to train myself. I must still seem like a baby chick to you."[lr]::
18837::$$$message_0144_0101_0001$$$::"Utterly. You are still a chirping chick. I can hardly entrust my mistress to the likes of you."::
18838::$$$message_0144_0102_0000$$$::Sella huffs and turns away.[lr]::
18839::$$$message_0144_0102_0001$$$::Maybe she's in a good mood after scolding me, or maybe something happened.[lr]::
18840::$$$message_0144_0102_0002$$$::I think I see a hint of a smile.::
18841::$$$message_0144_0103_0000$$$::"Ah, yes. I've already sent for the blanket, as promised. It should be at your chamber by the time you return."[lr]::
18842::$$$message_0144_0103_0001$$$::"Ah... Right, thanks. I completely forgot after the thing with Leys."[lr]::
18843::$$$message_0144_0103_0002$$$::"I shall take my leave, then.[lr]::
18844::$$$message_0144_0103_0003$$$::Thank you for your help in the wine cellar and the courtyard. If you require anything else, I will try to make sure your needs are met."::
18845::$$$message_0144_0104_0000$$$::Sella straightens her back and walks off briskly.[lr]::
18846::$$$message_0144_0104_0001$$$::"...Well."[lr]::
18847::$$$message_0144_0104_0002$$$::Guess I'd better head back to my bedroom.[lr]::
18848::$$$message_0144_0104_0003$$$::I'm exhausted after everything. That should help me fall asleep soon.::
918693::$$$message_9144_0050_0005$$$::"What a surprise. Shirou and Sella, are you friends?"[r]::

